<% content_for(:title) { "RugSuite ERP — software for carpet wash factories" } %>

<section class="mkt-hero">
  <div class="mkt-hero-inner">
    <div class="mkt-hero-text">
      <span class="mkt-eyebrow">Operations software for carpet wash factories</span>
      <h1 class="mkt-hero-title">Run your carpet wash factory like a tech company.</h1>
      <p class="mkt-hero-subtitle">
        RugSuite ERP replaces the spreadsheets, paper tickets and phone-tag with one platform that handles every step from booking to delivery — for one factory or a hundred.
      </p>
      <div class="mkt-hero-actions">
        <%= link_to "Start free trial", marketing_signup_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="mkt-hero-bullets">
        <li>Multi-tenant — one platform per company, one company per subdomain</li>
        <li>Per-factory pricing, currencies, languages and service areas</li>
        <li>Built on Rails 8 + Postgres — yours to host or ours to run</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="mkt-hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="mkt-hero-blob"></div>
      <div class="mkt-hero-grid"></div>
      <div class="mkt-hero-card mkt-hero-card-top">
        <div class="mkt-hero-card-row">
          <span class="mkt-pill mkt-pill-amber">Picked up</span>
          <span class="mkt-hero-card-time">14:32</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mkt-hero-card-meta">5 rugs · 23.8 kg · Acme Carpets</div>
      </div>
      <div class="mkt-hero-card mkt-hero-card-mid">
        <div class="mkt-hero-card-row">
          <span class="mkt-pill mkt-pill-blue">In wash</span>
          <span class="mkt-hero-card-time">15:08</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mkt-hero-card-meta">Drum 3 · Programme: Wool · ETA 16:40</div>
      </div>
      <div class="mkt-hero-card mkt-hero-card-bottom">
        <div class="mkt-hero-card-row">
          <span class="mkt-pill mkt-pill-green">Ready for delivery</span>
          <span class="mkt-hero-card-time">17:15</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mkt-hero-card-meta">Courier: Marko · 7 stops on route</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mkt-section" id="features">
  <div class="mkt-section-inner">
    <div class="mkt-section-head">
      <span class="mkt-eyebrow">What you get</span>
      <h2>Everything a wash factory needs, nothing it doesn't.</h2>
      <p class="mkt-section-lede">Purpose-built for the carpet wash workflow. No generic CRM contortions, no ERP bloat.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mkt-features">
      <article class="mkt-feature">
        <span class="mkt-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2"/><path d="M15 18H9"/><path d="M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14"/><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Pickup &amp; delivery routing</h3>
        <p>Customers book online. Couriers see today's stops in optimal order, swipe to confirm pickup, snap a photo, done. No more shouting addresses into the phone.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="mkt-feature">
        <span class="mkt-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Wash workflow, tracked</h3>
        <p>Every rug moves through pending → picked up → in wash → ready → delivered. Operators see what's in the building. Coordinators see what's overdue. Customers get an SMS when it's ready.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="mkt-feature">
        <span class="mkt-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v2"/><path d="M12 20v2"/><path d="m17 5-1.4 1.4"/><path d="m6.4 17.6-1.4 1.4"/><path d="M2 12h2"/><path d="M20 12h2"/><path d="m5 5 1.4 1.4"/><path d="m17.6 17.6 1.4 1.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Pricing that fits your business</h3>
        <p>Per-kilogram, per-item, bulk discounts, vouchers, free pickup zones — configure once, apply everywhere. Multi-currency from day one.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="mkt-feature">
        <span class="mkt-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m22 6-10 7L2 6"/><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Customer notifications</h3>
        <p>Booking confirmations, price quotes, "your rug is ready" alerts — automated by SMS in the customer's own language. You stop chasing, customers stop calling.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="mkt-feature">
        <span class="mkt-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="m7 17 4-7 4 5 5-8"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Reports the office actually reads</h3>
        <p>Daily intake, revenue by week, courier performance, churn signals. Plain charts, exportable to CSV. No data lake required.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="mkt-feature">
        <span class="mkt-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Roles &amp; tenant isolation</h3>
        <p>Admin, coordinator, operator, courier — each role sees only what they need. Every factory's data is hard-isolated; nothing leaks between tenants.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mkt-section mkt-section-alt" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="mkt-section-inner">
    <div class="mkt-section-head">
      <span class="mkt-eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2>From web form to washed rug in 5 steps.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="mkt-steps">
      <li class="mkt-step">
        <span class="mkt-step-num">01</span>
        <h3>Customer books online</h3>
        <p>A clean public form on your subdomain. Address validated against Google Maps, pickup window picked, SMS confirmation sent.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="mkt-step">
        <span class="mkt-step-num">02</span>
        <h3>Courier picks up</h3>
        <p>Today's stops in optimal order on the courier's phone. Confirm pickup, count the rugs, move on.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="mkt-step">
        <span class="mkt-step-num">03</span>
        <h3>Operator weighs &amp; washes</h3>
        <p>Weight or item count goes in, the system calculates the price, the customer gets a quote SMS, the rug enters the wash queue.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="mkt-step">
        <span class="mkt-step-num">04</span>
        <h3>Coordinator schedules delivery</h3>
        <p>Done rugs are bundled into a delivery route. Customer chooses or confirms the slot. Courier delivers, customer pays.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="mkt-step">
        <span class="mkt-step-num">05</span>
        <h3>You see the numbers</h3>
        <p>Daily intake, weekly revenue, courier load, repeat-customer share — visible on a single dashboard, exportable on demand.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mkt-section" id="pricing">
  <div class="mkt-section-inner">
    <div class="mkt-section-head">
      <span class="mkt-eyebrow">Pricing</span>
      <h2>Pricing that scales with your factory.</h2>
      <p class="mkt-section-lede">Pay-as-you-grow. No setup fees, no per-courier nickel-and-dime, no surprises. Talk to us for an exact quote.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mkt-pricing">
      <div class="mkt-tier">
        <h3 class="mkt-tier-name">Starter</h3>
        <p class="mkt-tier-tagline">One factory, getting started.</p>
        <p class="mkt-tier-price"><span>€49</span><small>/month</small></p>
        <ul class="mkt-tier-list">
          <li>Up to 300 orders / month</li>
          <li>3 staff users</li>
          <li>SMS notifications (pay as you go)</li>
          <li>Email support</li>
        </ul>
        <%= link_to "Start free trial", marketing_signup_path, class: "btn btn-secondary btn-full" %>
      </div>
      <div class="mkt-tier mkt-tier-featured">
        <span class="mkt-tier-badge">Most popular</span>
        <h3 class="mkt-tier-name">Pro</h3>
        <p class="mkt-tier-tagline">Established factory, multiple couriers.</p>
        <p class="mkt-tier-price"><span>€149</span><small>/month</small></p>
        <ul class="mkt-tier-list">
          <li>Up to 2,000 orders / month</li>
          <li>Unlimited staff users</li>
          <li>Route optimisation included</li>
          <li>SMS bundle (1,500 / month)</li>
          <li>Priority support</li>
        </ul>
        <%= link_to "Start free trial", marketing_signup_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-full" %>
      </div>
      <div class="mkt-tier">
        <h3 class="mkt-tier-name">Enterprise</h3>
        <p class="mkt-tier-tagline">Multi-location or white-label.</p>
        <p class="mkt-tier-price"><span>Custom</span></p>
        <ul class="mkt-tier-list">
          <li>Unlimited orders</li>
          <li>Multi-location / multi-tenant</li>
          <li>Custom domain, branding</li>
          <li>SSO, audit logs, SLA</li>
          <li>Onboarding included</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary btn-full">Talk to us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mkt-section mkt-section-cta" id="signup">
  <div class="mkt-section-inner mkt-cta">
    <h2>Ready to run your factory on RugSuite?</h2>
    <p>Set up a tenant in under a minute. Free trial, no credit card.</p>
    <div class="mkt-cta-actions">
      <%= link_to "Start free trial", marketing_signup_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Talk to us first</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mkt-section" id="contact">
  <div class="mkt-section-inner mkt-contact">
    <div>
      <span class="mkt-eyebrow">Contact</span>
      <h2>We answer fast.</h2>
      <p>If you run a carpet wash factory and the workflow above sounds familiar, we want to hear from you. Tell us a bit about how many orders you do today and where you operate.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="mkt-contact-list">
      <li><strong>Email</strong><a href="mailto:hello@rugsuite.app">hello@rugsuite.app</a></li>
      <li><strong>Sales</strong><a href="mailto:sales@rugsuite.app">sales@rugsuite.app</a></li>
      <li><strong>Support</strong><a href="mailto:support@rugsuite.app">support@rugsuite.app</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
